00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:25.040
Some reporting notes the potential for limited agreements on specific issues while broader differences remain, which specific outcomes would be viewed as progress by each side.

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:36.520
Next, 10 residents from UK overseas territories in the South Atlantic are being brought to Britain for further observation after exposure to Huntavirus.

